{"id":"leetcode-561","version":1,"status":"approved","title":"Array Partition","summary":"Given an integer array nums containing 2n elements, arrange the elements into n pairs to maximize the sum of the minimum values in each pair.","statement":"Given an integer array nums containing 2n elements, arrange the elements into n pairs to maximize the sum of the minimum values in each pair. Return the highest possible sum.","constraints":["2 <= len(nums) <= 20,000; length is even; -10,000 <= nums[i] <= 10,000.","Partition into pairs to maximize the sum of the smaller value in every pair."],"topics":["arrays","greedy","sorting"],"prerequisites":[],"signature":{"name":"maximum_pair_min_sum","parameters":[{"name":"nums","annotation":"list[int]","adapter":"raw","source_parameter":null}],"returns":"int","return_adapter":"raw","node_policy":"values","result_mode":"return","mutated_parameter":null,"immutable_parameters":[]},"starter_code":"def maximum_pair_min_sum(nums: list[int]) -> int:\n    # Write your solution here.\n    pass\n","reference_solution":"def maximum_pair_min_sum(nums):\n    nums=sorted(nums)\n    return sum(nums[::2])\n","brute_force_solution":null,"known_wrong_solutions":["def maximum_pair_min_sum(nums):\n    nums=sorted(nums)\n    return sum(nums[1::2])\n","def maximum_pair_min_sum(nums):\n    nums=list(nums)\n    return sum(nums[::2])\n"],"target_time_complexity":"O(n log n)","target_space_complexity":"O(n)","estimated_minutes":20,"rubric":{"algorithmic_insight":1,"prerequisites":1,"implementation":1,"performance_pressure":0,"edge_cases":0},"hints":["Large values should not be wasted as the partner of a small value.","Sort and pair adjacent values.","Sort nums; sum indices 0,2,4,...","An exchange argument removes crossed pairings without lowering the sum of pair minima."],"editorial":"An exchange argument removes crossed pairings without lowering the sum of pair minima.","tests":[{"id":"lc-561-1","arguments":[[1,4,3,2]],"expected":4,"comparator":"exact","vis